      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Mr Dunmore, a glass of water in the middle of the night is a perfectly sensible thing to do. Let me ask the main thing I'm checking. Have you been vomiting at all?",
